# The pinned spec snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ IS committed: every
# refresh is then a reviewable diff against the hash pin in
# provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json. So are provider-dev/source (split and
# normalized service specs), provider-dev/openapi (the generated provider),
# provider-dev/config/all_services.csv (the mapping contract) and
# website/docs (so pages stamp with their regeneration date).

# integration test registry copy (rebuilt every run)
tests/integration/.registry-tmp/
